      "extract": "The aim of this article is to clarify new and sometimes unexpected structures of affine cellular algebras and properties of embeddings into asymptotic algebras, to illustrate these structures and properties by examples and to put them into the context of algebraic Lie theory. This continues and builds upon \\cite{KXaffine} and \\cite{CKLS}. Plenty of finite dimensional algebras arising in algebraic Lie theory have",
