      "extract": "In this section, the asymptotic algebra of an affine cellular algebra and the embedding of an affine cellular algebra into its asymptotic algebra will be described in detail. Moreover, the asymptotic algebra will be constructed as endomorphism ring in a double centraliser property. This proves Theorems A and D. Let $A$ be an affine cellular algebra with cell chain \\begin{equation}\\label{notation:cellchain} 0=J_0",
